# Relay — developer route plan
R B:2.95,3.4 for 1           # magenta high on the back wall
R until x>=9.8
R until air
R A:13.5,29 for 1            # cyan on the pit floor, mid-air
L until vx<=0.2
- until tele                 # fling 1: out of the back wall at full fall speed
- until x>=20
- A:48.5,27.2 for 1          # mid-flight: cyan onto the pad where we will come down
- B:51.5,27.2 for 1          # ...and magenta beside it
- until tele                 # the relay: in falling, out rising, speed kept
- until grounded
R until x>=152.2             # off the far end of the ledge
R A:160.5,27.2 for 1         # cyan on the patch below where we'll land
R B:151.05,10.5 for 1        # magenta on the ledge's far face
- until tele                 # second relay: out of the ledge going right
- until grounded
R until finished
